CortexOS Credits
================

Cristopher Borjas — project author and maintainer.

CortexOS is an independent educational operating-system project. It draws
architectural inspiration from established Unix-like systems without copying
kernel implementation code.

Third-party software
--------------------

External sources are kept under third_party/ or tools/archinstall/upstream/.
Their authors, licenses, and attribution notices remain in their own trees.
They are not treated as CortexOS kernel code.
